details_from_meter.description:
Details needed to calculate your monthly fixed fees. The fields were filled in from the meter of the Enea Licznik integration – check them against your invoice.

The meter shows:
- phases: {phases}
- billing period (months): {billing_months}
- annual consumption (kWh): {annual_kwh}, year up to {annual_until}

Fields marked “—” are left open by the meter and keep their defaults.

change_prices.description:
Your price history (each change holds until the next one; the URE tariff before the first):
{history}

Add new prices from the day you started paying them – earlier months keep their prices. To fix a typo, enter the prices again with the same date as the latest change.

reconfigure_from_meter.description:
Update the details used to calculate your monthly fixed fees. The fields show the current settings, and the next step lets you change the energy prices.

The meter of the Enea Licznik integration shows:
- phases: {phases}
- billing period (months): {billing_months}
- annual consumption (kWh): {annual_kwh}, year up to {annual_until}
